r my soup  to cool down let's move on and prep  lunch tempeh fried rice for this young  three cups of cooked brown rice one cup  of temper a half a head of broccoli one  red bell pepper one carrot three stalks  of scallions two tablespoons of olive  oil two tablespoons of soy sauce one  teaspoon of sesame oil and salt and  pepper to taste again start by prepping  all the vegetables and sliced the tempeh  into cubes heat a large pan with one  tablespoon of olive oil over medium-high  heat salted the tempeh until it is  slightly Brown remove and set aside  drizzle the remaining one tablespoon of  oil over medium-high heat then add in  your vegetables broccoli bell pepper and  carrots cook for four to five minutes  until the vegetables are slightly tender  but still crunchy then stir in the rice  and tempeh and continue to cook for a  few more minutes until the rice is  heated through season with a little bit  of soy sauce sesame oil and salt and  pepper then throw in some scallions and  continue to stir until all the  ingredients are well combined remove  from heat and set it aside to cool down  now let's move on and make breakfast  tofu and vegetable rice rolls for this  you'll need 200 grams of firm tofu one  red bell pepper one yellow bell pepper  one carrot one large bunch of mint  leaves one and a half cups of cabbage  two tablespoons of olive oil and in 12  rice paper rolls add for the garlic soy  dipping sauce you'll need two  tablespoons of soy sauce half a  tablespoon of rice vinegar 2 teaspoons  of sesame oil and one teaspoon of minced  garlic  let's start by Finley slicing all the  vegetables and sliced the tofu into long  strips over medium-high heat cook the  tofu on each side for about three to  five minutes or until golden brown  set aside next we want to prep the  dipping sauce so in a small bowl combine  all the ingredients together and mix  well now let's assemble the rice rolls  to soften the rice paper wraps in a  large plate add in a little bit of warm  water and dip the rice  Rep very quickly for 10 to 15 seconds  and spread it carefully onto a damp  cloth then arrange all the colorful  vegetables and tofu gently roll the rice  paper wrap and voila there you have it  so I'm making child rose enough for  three days if you want to you can always  make more finally I'm going to prep a  really simple and quick snack  rate date stuffed with walnuts this is a  very popular Chinese snack it is sweet  satisfying and extremely healthy so  combined with walnuts this snack is high  in antioxidants and also healthy fats  simply slice the red date to create a  small pocket and remove the seed then  insert half a walnut into the red date  then now that all the meals have cooked  down it is time to store them into  airtight containers I'm going to scoop  the soup into three equal portions then  place for rice rolls into each container  as for lunch  I'm packing fried rice with more  vegetables on the side always remember  that you can consume vegetables in  abundance and finally the red dates and  walnuts as my snacks so this is my meal  prep for three days the total calories  for all the meals are only 1200 calories  remember this does not include my  protein shake which I will have after a  workout session or a cup of coffee or a  small dessert just to enjoy so I will  give myself another 3 to 400 calorie  allowance use this as your guideline  remember your calorie intake will differ  based on your fitness goals and also  your body composition do try this meal  prep out and let me know what recipes do  you want more up remember you have to  also stay active ok so check out my  workout videos  and don't forget to subscribe to my  youtube channel and turn on your  notification button and be sure to snap  pictures and tag me all the best

